{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07314","headline":"初至洞庭怀灞陵别业 · 刘长卿","name":"初至洞庭怀灞陵别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安邈千里，日夕怀双阙。\n已是洞庭人，犹看灞陵月。\n谁堪去乡意，亲戚想天末。\n昨夜梦中归，烟波觉来阔。\n江臯见芳草，孤客心欲绝。\n岂讶青春来，但伤经时别。\n长天不可望，鸟与浮云没。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}